es financial  advising that you could tie  in to make you different because  everybody's doing this thing man  you gotta stand out and so his thing was  hockey  and at the start like hockey like what  does hockey have to do with financial  advising  right but steve's the kind of guy who  can watch  sportscenter and watch hockey replays  and watch the same goal  20 times and still love it and his wife  looks at him he's like steve you're  crazy  what are you doing but he loves it if  you start talking hockey to steve  it's over this is a fantastic  find and you may think at the start what  the heck does hockey and financial  advising advice have to do with each  other  but it's the way for him to stand out  because you know what he does now you  look at  financial advisors they try to target  high net worth individuals right  you want you want a portfolio people  have millions of dollars not  ten thousand dollars and so who who does  it go after now  hockey players he goes after  professional  nhl hockey players and they have  millions of dollars  and he has an in because when he's  talking to them  he's a huge hockey nut and so are they  and if he's going up against other  financial advisors who just see them  with a big ticket  but don't really care about hockey that  much they're not going to win steve is  going to win  every time and once he starts working  with a few of them  they pass his name on say yeah you got  to work with this guy  he really gets it that's how he stands  out  and he's able to win huge deals  in a massively competitive field because  he is  different because he brings himself  to his business because he combines his  passions  how boring is your business right now if  i go to your website can i click to  learn more about you  what does it tell me if you're giving me  a boring corporate bio  with a boring corporate picture or no  picture  you're not hitting me tell me why you  started this business tell me why it  means something to you  if 